/F1 9 Tf 50 780 Td (Press Information Bureau \(PIB\) Government of India ? PRID=2197713 \(12 December 2025\)) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 758 Tm /F2 12 Tf ([SECTION: PIB Release PRID=2197713] Criteria for Assessing Losses under Pradhan Mantri Fasal Bima Yojana \(Published 12 DEC 2025\)) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 740 Tm /F1 10 Tf ([PARA | SEC=PIB Release PRID=2197713 \(Para 1-2\)] Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare, Government of India \(Release Date: 2025-12-12, PRID=2197713\). Pradhan Mantri Fasal Bima Yojana \(PMFBY\) is voluntary for States as well as farmers and provides comprehensive risk insurance from pre-sowing to post-harvest stages against non-preventable natural risks.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 724 Tm /F1 10 Tf ([PARA | SEC=PIB Release PRID=2197713 \(Para 3 - Wild Animal Attack Add-on Cover\)] Wild Animal Attack Add-on Cover: Losses caused by wild animal attacks were historically excluded from basic cover. States have been permitted to notify wild animal attack as an add-on cover based on individual assessment, implemented 100.0% at the cost of the respective State Government \(0.0% Central Government subsidy liability for wild animal add-on cover\). A technical committee submitted Standard Operating Procedures \(SOPs\) for wild animal attack loss assessment and localized inundation for paddy crops.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 708 Tm /F1 10 Tf ([PARA | SEC=PIB Release PRID=2197713 \(Para 4 - Scope & Versioning Limitation\)] Scope and Versioning Notice: This December 2025 PIB press release \(PRID=2197713, published 2025-12-12\) announces loss-assessment SOP modalities for wild animal attacks and hydrophilic crop \(paddy, jute, mesta, sugarcane\) inundation. It does NOT publish a complete revised 2025/2026 Operational Guidelines text or specify an effective date or revised farmer premium rate table.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 40 Tm /F1 9 Tf ([PRINTED_PAGE: 1]) Tj
